{"id":79954462994053,"type":"artist","name":"Satyricon","artist":null,"year":1990,"weight":30,"info":{"tags":["black metal","Norwegian Black Metal","norwegian","melodic black metal","metal"],"country":"NO","begin":"1990","kind":"Group","similar":["Immortal","Gorgoroth","1349","Dimmu Borgir","Darkthrone","Marduk","Dark Funeral","Taake","Behemoth","Emperor"],"disambiguation":"Norwegian black metal band","img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Satyricon%2C_Metaltown_2008.jpg?width=500","bio":"Satyricon es unos de los más conocidos grupos de black metal noruego. Ha sido una de las primeras bandas de black noruego en incorporar elementos de musica medieval y atmosférica, aunque después de su segundo álbum han optado por un sonido más veloz y agresivo.\nSatyricon se forma en Oslo (Noruega) en 1990 por Satyr (voces), Lemarchand (guitarra,), Exhurtum (batería) y Wargod(bajo).\n\nGraban una demo homónima y poco después Wargod y Exhurtum dejan la banda: el primero por razones desconocidas"},"works":[{"id":53128191589853,"type":"album","name":"Dark Medieval Times","artist":"Satyricon","year":1993,"weight":9,"yt":"ff_uv337yIE","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":59251635065665,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1993","rank":115,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":1130,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":69173627889632,"type":"album","name":"Nemesis Divina","artist":"Satyricon","year":1996,"weight":14,"yt":"kPhRmUM0n-8","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":187561999930396,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1996","rank":100,"scaruffi":null},{"id":31538438098055,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Black Metal","rank":111,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":57708647919165,"type":"album","name":"Volcano","artist":"Satyricon","year":2002,"weight":3,"yt":"j7qgOVfadKA","src":"musthear","from":